<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets call warrants on Cheung Kong.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on Cheung Kong.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong</p>
<p>Kong branch said on Monday it has launched 65 million</p>
<p>American-style call warrants on shares of Cheung Kong (Holdings)</p>
<p>Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$83	    PREMIUM	   20.708 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.8138	GEARING	   9.34x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  21.NOV.97	EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	SETTLEMENT DATE 21.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$76	    LISTING DATE    26.FEB.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
